 ["A person is sure they know a word and can recall its first letter but not the word. Which experience is this?","the tip-of-the-tongue phenomenon","déjà vu","a flashbulb memory","The tip-of-the-tongue phenomenon is partial retrieval of a word with a strong feeling of knowing."],
 ["A person walks into a new place and feels strongly that they have been there before. Which experience is this commonly called?","déjà vu","the tip-of-the-tongue phenomenon","source amnesia","Déjà vu is a feeling of familiarity with a new situation, and its causes are not settled."]
